{"parentUuid":"ec32d0a3-6ad4-4db8-859d-0cc2e48a41da","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"a67cf942cd679915d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Ryn7aGVi6DQB6Bq4WxgyL","type":"tool_result","content":"# Encoding and Constraint Parameters from sat_parameters.proto\n\nBased on the provided file content, here are the relevant parameters:\n\n## Linear Encoding\n\n**encode_complex_linear_constraint_with_integer** (line 223)\n- Type: `optional bool`\n- Default: `false`\n- Purpose: \"Linear constraint with a complex right hand side (more than a single interval) need to be expanded\"\n\n## Table Constraint Encoding\n\n**table_compression_level** (line 217)\n- Type: `optional int32`\n- Default: `2`\n- Purpose: \"How much we try to compress a table constraint. Compressing more leads to less Booleans and faster propagation but can reduced the quality of the lp relaxation. Values goes from 0 to 3\"\n\n**detect_table_with_cost** (line 216)\n- Type: `optional bool`\n- Default: `false`\n- Purpose: Detects variables unique to table constraints used for encoding costs\n\n## Constraint Expansion Controls\n\n**disable_constraint_expansion** (line 181)\n- Type: `optional bool`\n- Default: `false`\n- Purpose: \"If true, it disable all constraint expansion\"\n\n**max_lin_max_size_for_expansion** (line 280)\n- Type: `optional int32`\n- Default: `0`\n- Purpose: Controls expansion of lin_max constraints\n\n**max_domain_size_for_linear2_expansion** (line 340)\n- Type: `optional int32`\n- Default: `8`\n- Purpose: Domain size limit for linear2 constraint expansion\n\nNote: The specific parameters you mentioned (boolean_encoding_level, linearization_level, search_branching, new_linear_propagation) do not appear in the visible portion of this file."}]},"uuid":"f7856c9e-41fd-4370-a2ad-ace21cfe6638","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:26:08.277Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ec32d0a3-6ad4-4db8-859d-0cc2e48a41da","userType":"exte